ibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">mixed (4)</bdi></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[length:var(--type-caption)]" data-gold-lane="dollar" data-gold-lane-reading="strong"><span class="min-w-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Dollar</span><bdi class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">strong (1)</bdi></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[length:var(--type-caption)]" data-gold-lane="stress" data-gold-lane-reading="unreadable"><span class="min-w-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Market stress</span><bdi class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">no read</bdi></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[length:var(--type-caption)]" data-gold-lane="inflation" data-gold-lane-reading="cool"><span class="min-w-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Inflation</span><bdi class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">cooling (1) · expectations fading</bdi></li></ul><span class="mt-2 block border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-2 text-[length:var(--type-caption)] font-medium text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Firing drivers</span><ul class="m-0 mt-1 flex list-none flex-col gap-0.5 p-0" data-gold-voters="true"><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] leading-4" data-gold-voter="real-yield-10y" data-gold-voter-impact="tailwind"><span class="min-w-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Real yields<span class="ms-1 text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">· falling</span></span><bdi class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">tailwind</bdi></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] leading-4" data-gold-voter="us10y" data-gold-voter-impact="tailwind"><span class="min-w-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">US 10-year yield<span class="ms-1 text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">· falling</span></span><bdi class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">tailwind</bdi></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] leading-4" data-gold-voter="us30y" data-gold-voter-impact="headwind"><span class="min-w-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">US 30-year yield<span class="ms-1 text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">· high in its decade</span></span><bdi class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">headwind</bdi></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] leading-4" data-gold-voter="fed-expectations" data-gold-voter-impact="headwind"><span class="min-w-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Fed expectations<span class="ms-1 text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">· high in its decade</span></span><bdi class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">headwind</bdi></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] leading-4" data-gold-voter="usdjpy" data-gold-voter-impact="headwind"><span class="min-w-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">USD/JPY<span class="ms-1 text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">· high in its decade</span></span><bdi class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">headwind</bdi></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] leading-4" data-gold-voter="breakeven-5y5y" data-gold-voter-impact="headwind"><span class="min-w-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">5y5y breakeven<span class="ms-1 text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">· falling</span></span><bdi class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">headwind</bdi></li></ul><span class="mt-auto block pt-2 text-[11px] leading-4 text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]" data-gold-footnotes="true">A descriptive score of the classic driver relationships — conditions, not advice.<span class="mt-1 block" data-gold-measured-note="true">Measured against gold’s actual moves over 2016–2026: the table’s lean showed no positive association with the next 5–60 days — if anything, headwind readings came before larger rises. It reads conditions, not direction. <a href="https://github.com/assadigit/Currena/blob/main/docs/insights/BACKTEST-GOLD.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="insights-focusable text-[var(--color-status-context)] underline decoration-[var(--color-accent-brand)]/40 underline-offset-2">Read the full backtest</a></span></span></article><article id="insights-gold-model-vs-reality" class="gold-panel flex h-full flex-col rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] bg-currena-soft/60 p-3 ring-1 ring-[var(--color-border)]" data-mvr-chip="aligned-headwind"><span class="flex w-full items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-git-compare-arrows currena-icon shrink-0 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]" aria-hidden="true" style="--icon-size: 18px;"><circle cx="5" cy="6" r="3"></circle><path d="M12 6h5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7"></path><path d="m15 9-3-3 3-3"></path><circle cx="19" cy="18" r="3"></circle><path d="M12 18H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V9"></path><path d="m9 15 3 3-3 3"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h4 class="m-0 text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold leading-tight text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Model vs reality</h4><span class="block text-[length:var(--type-caption)] leading-snug text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Does the macro score agree with what gold actually did?</span></span></span><span class="mt-2.5 inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--color-surface)] px-3 py-1 text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] ring-1 ring-[var(--color-border)]" data-mvr-chip-word="true">Aligned — headwind</span><bdi class="mt-2.5 block text-[length:var(--type-label)] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">The macro drivers lean against gold and the price has moved -7.8% over the past 30 days — the weakness has company.</bdi><span class="mt-auto block pt-2 text-[11px] leading-4 text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">The model reads the drivers; reality reads the price. Both can be wrong.</span></article></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-3"><h4 class="m-0 text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">Price footing</h4><ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-1.5 p-0"><li class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] px-2.5 py-2 ring-1 ring-[var(--color-border)]" data-footing-metal="gold" data-footing-state="against"><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false" decoding="async" class="currena-icon shrink-0 select-none " style="--icon-size: 24px; --icon-size-sm: 30px;" src="/assets/icons/gold.png"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-[var(--color-status-alert)]"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.5 6.5l4 4 2.5-2.5 4.5 5"></path></svg><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold">Works against</span></span></span><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Gold</span><bdi dir="ltr" class="text-[length:var(--type-caption)] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">US$3,876</bdi><span class="text-[length:var(--type-caption)] text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">high of the last 10 years</span><span class="ms-auto flex items-baseline gap-1 text-[length:var(--type-caption)] text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">30-day speed:<bdi dir="ltr" class="font-semibold tabular-nums">−7.76%</bdi></span></span><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">A price holding or rising in its 10-year range is firm footing; a falling one is not.</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] px-2.5 py-2 ring-1 ring-[var(--color-border)]" data-footing-metal="silver" data-footing-state="unknown"><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false" decoding="async" class="currena-icon shrink-0 select-none " style="--icon-size: 24px; --icon-size-sm: 30px;" src="/assets/icons/silver.png"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-[var(--color-status-stale)]"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.2"></circle><path d="M8 4.6V8l2.4 1.6"></path></svg><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold">Cannot read</span></span></span><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Silver</span></span><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">A price holding or rising in its 10-year range is firm footing; a falling one is not.</span></li></ul></div>"`;
